## Block Diagonal Matrix

Block diagonal: Suppose $n = \sum_b n_b$. For linear equations, $(\sum_b n_b)^3$ (without using block diagonal structure) vs $\sum_b n_b^3$ (using block diagonal structure).

::: {#54 .cell execution_count=0}
